st', https://investorrelations.sgx.com/static-files/9ef0a612-b4bb-4c44-9632-d01f40f206fd; the 2011 Practice Note version gives Non-Cancel 17:05-17:06), and 2017-11-13 (SGX-ST rule amendments of 13 November 2017, https://rulebook.sgx.com/sites/default/files/net_file_store/SGX-ST_November_13_2017.pdf, which add the 12:00-13:00 Mid-Day Break and move the half-day Closing Routine from 12:30-12:36 to 12:00-12:06). The schema cannot date a lunch break, so the 2011-2017 continuous session is described here only. Not changed (4c8 stop rule, more than 10 dated corrections): the 2028-2029 half days (2028-01-25, 2029-02-12, 2029-12-24, 2029-12-31) still close at 12:30; they should be 12:06 and are marked unconfirmed on the 2028-2029 span.",
